{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mantian-e-p156a","title":"素利遗牛马怀金豫张袖受之去后付外具状闻","accounts":[{"id":"mantian-a-aa0da28672285bc9e8fb","label":"裴注·《魏略》","text":"素利遗牛马怀金豫张袖受之去后付外具状闻","evidence":["mantian-q-8782421387a30aa0e9f4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mantian-p0036","role":"遗牛马、密怀金三十斤","evidence":["mantian-q-8782421387a30aa0e9f4"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0025","role":"转送官、张袖受金答厚意、悉付外具状闻","evidence":["mantian-q-8782421387a30aa0e9f4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["mantian-q-8782421387a30aa0e9f4"]},"ordering_evidence":"mantian-q-8782421387a30aa0e9f4","source_order":[26,198,10],"order":5209}],"persons":[{"id":"mantian-p0036","name":"素利","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0025","name":"田豫","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mantian-q-8782421387a30aa0e9f4","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-1e9ad340e7a92f2569f9","layer":"pei","quote":"鲜卑素利等，数来客见，多以牛马遗豫；豫转送官。胡以为前所与豫物，显露，不如持金。乃密怀金三十斤，谓豫曰：‘愿避左右，我欲有所道。’豫从之，胡因跪曰：‘我见公贫，故前后遗公牛马；公辄送官。今密以此上公，可以为家资。’豫张袖受之，答其厚意。胡去之后，皆悉付外，具以状闻","attribution":"裴注·《魏略》","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":197,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b38ada4d67ad27c8e27e","start":10,"end":142}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
